# Self Document
After every single shipment of code, ensure that you have self-documented anything that you learned during the session.  This would include any information that is useful for you in future sessions to keep everything cohesive.

# Where to Self Document
This should be kept in a docs folder within the project and something that can be also saved and pushed up to the repository.

# After Self Documenting
Ensure to push changes to documents up to both dev and main branches of the repository.
